// ============================================================================
// ASM Functions — Direct 6502 Instruction Access
// ============================================================================
// All 56 official 6502 opcodes with addressing mode variants (151 functions).
// Each function maps to exactly one 6502 instruction.
// These are compiler-handled stubs — no Blend implementation.
// ============================================================================

module asm;

